   "term": "The game in the voice",
   "gloss": "The platform gamifies music-making exactly as it gamifies play. Repitching to evade censors is a rule-bound, adversarial game with a cancellable referee, and a weird move's value decays once the platform makes it a trackable metric. Voiceshifting is sonic gilded time, and the trending sound is a trophy.",
